    "derivation": "raw_input/component_material re-spell the frozen legacy parameters of http_listener_to_rest/plain (naming.component_prefix; listener object_name/operation_type/payload_profile -> material.listener.request_profile; inbound_validation.enabled -> raw_input.listener.inbound_validation; target binding/send_request/payload_profile -> the shared REST blocks, the placeholder path '/v1/<<target resource>>' sanitized to '/v1/target-resource' (the shared request-target grammar refuses '<', '>' and space; no row carries the path); transform source_path -> source_field). expected.supporting_component_keys = the baseline producer's components for this input at ba1be9f3 in emission order with main_process excluded; expected.references = that baseline main_process's depends_on, sorted; execution profile 'listener' = the canonical rule for a listener entry step."
  },
